---
import Workspace from './Workspace.astro';
---
<Workspace area="client" heading="Performance overview" description="Your results, with the context to understand them.">
<div id="status" class="admin-notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">Opening your workspace…</div>
<section id="welcome" class="admin-welcome" hidden><h2>Welcome to your workspace</h2><p>See the Instagram accounts and one-off projects shared with you, with clear month-over-month comparisons.</p><p>Open your private invitation email to get started, or sign in below if you already have access.</p><div id="clerk-sign-in" class="clerk-container"></div><p class="small">Use the email address on your invitation. Your administrator manages which accounts and projects you can access.</p></section>
<div id="dashboard" hidden><section class="toolbar" aria-label="Report selection"><div class="target-control"><label for="target">ACCOUNT / PROJECT</label><select id="target"></select></div><div class="month-control"><label for="month">REPORTING MONTH</label><div class="month-input"><button id="previous-month" aria-label="Previous month">←</button><input type="month" id="month" min="1000-01" max="9999-12"/><button id="next-month" aria-label="Next month">→</button></div></div></section>
<section class="target-heading"><img id="theme-logo" hidden alt=""/><div class="target-avatar" aria-hidden="true" id="target-avatar">◎</div><div><p id="theme-eyebrow" hidden></p><h2 id="target-name"></h2><p id="target-detail"></p><p id="theme-tagline" hidden></p></div><span id="target-status" class="quiet-pill"></span></section>
<div class="theme-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="section-heading"><h2>At a glance</h2><p id="comparison-label"></p></div><section id="metrics" class="metrics" aria-label="Key performance indicators"></section>
<section class="detail-grid"><div class="panel comparison-panel"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Two months, side by side</h2><span class="quiet-pill">Monthly snapshot</span></div><p class="muted">Exact period values. No estimated trends.</p><div id="comparison-chart" class="comparison-chart"></div><div class="legend"><span><i class="current-dot"></i> Selected month</span><span><i class="previous-dot"></i> Previous month</span></div></div><aside class="panel context-panel"><span class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE NUMBERS</span><h2>Good data.<br/>Clear perspective.</h2><p>Comparisons are shown only when both periods have complete readings.</p><div class="context-rule"><strong>Percentage points ≠ percent</strong><p>A rate moving from 4% to 5% is +1 percentage point, or +25% relative growth.</p></div><div class="context-rule"><strong>A snapshot, not a live feed</strong><p>Check each metric’s collection date and source below. Data may be entered or imported by your team.</p></div></aside></section>
<section class="panel data-panel"><div class="section-heading"><h2>The full picture</h2><span class="muted">Values & provenance</span></div><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Metric readings, horizontally scrollable"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Selected month</th><th scope="col">Previous month</th><th scope="col">Change</th><th scope="col">Quality / source</th></tr></thead><tbody id="metric-rows"></tbody></table></div></section></div>
</Workspace>
<script>import '../scripts/dashboard';</script>
